OL,3,AMSPs asked to pause Scotland's AI data
OL,4,Acentre boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland has a new boom industry, at
OL,7,Fleast if planning applications are
OL,8,Ftaken at face value.
OL,10,FThe term "hyperscale data centre",
OL,11,Frarely heard a few years ago, is now
OL,12,Fdividing opinion across the country as
OL,13,Fa rush of applications are made to
OL,14,Fbuild them.
OL,16,FA debate at Holyrood later, led by the
OL,17,FScottish Greens, will call for planning
OL,18,Fapplications to be put on hold until
OL,19,Fpromised new national guidelines are in
OL,20,Fforce, with an emphasis on energy
OL,21,Fdemand and the environment.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
