OL,3,AMSPs asked to pause Scotland's AI data
OL,4,Acentre boom
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the debate, ministers
OL,7,Fannounced that all new applications for
OL,8,FAI data centres will have to undergo an
OL,9,Fenvironmental impact assessment.
